WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.695
The last Shuttle from this pad.

00:02.375 --> 00:05.516
Pad thirty-nine B saw fifty-three Space Shuttle launches.

00:06.008 --> 00:12.538
The last, S T S one sixteen, left in the dark with a crew of seven for the International Space Station.

00:13.184 --> 00:15.354
Discovery was the Shuttle on the pad.
